p "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a thick liquid that has vegetables (tomatoes, corn, etc.)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I put tomatoes and corn in my vegetable soup."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le02ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear at a grocery store."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bean"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a legume; a small round food added to dishes"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There are different kinds of beans. My favorite are lima beans."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le02ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "short "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "small or little"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  My brother is short. He is not tall."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le02ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tall "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "big"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I am tall. I can touch the ceiling."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le02ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to need "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to require a thing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to buy vegetables at the grocery store."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le02ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to make "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to create; produce or cook"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What do you make for dinner?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le02ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Ask For and Offer Help"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can ask for help in a polite way when you need assistance. <br /> Look at the ways to ask for help and offer help."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":\"04\",\"columns\":\"03\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Ask for Help </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Offer Help </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Accept Help </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I can help you with that.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Thank you, that's nice.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you help me \u2026 ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'll ... for you.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Yes, that would be great.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could I ask you to ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Want me to \u2026 ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sure, thanks!\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use basic information in simple situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands basic information in English texts according to the communicative topics of this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Completes simple dialogues by the addition or selection of appropriate language according to the communicative functions of this level. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn1le02ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Count and Non-Count Nouns"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Count nouns are things you can count. They are a number. Count nouns can be singular or plural nouns.  <br/> Non-count nouns are amounts. They are singular nouns. <br/><br/>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Notice</span>: The non-count <span class\"italics\"> corn</span> does NOT change.  It stays the same."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Count </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Non-Count</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"singular = tomato <br/>plural = tomatoes \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"corn\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can you hand me the tomato? <br/>Please add corn to the salad. </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Write a dialogue with your partner between you and a person who works in a grocery store."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask for help and offer help to get your ingredients."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Accept the clerk's help and be polite."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 3 lines for each person. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice your dialogue with a partner. "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example:</span><br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Shopper</span>: Excuse me. Can you help me reach the beans?<br/> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Clerk</span>: Sure. Here you are.<br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Shopper</span>:  Can you help me find the tomatoes?<br/>  <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Clerk</span>: Sure. They are next to the cucumbers.<br/>  <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Shopper</span>: Thank you.<br/> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Clerk</span>: You're welcome.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write 3 lines for each person. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use expressions asking for help. "}]}]}